# ---- prod-safety healthcheck (port of the Fixed ops console's ops-healthcheck cron, in-process) ----
# Read-only probes every N minutes: console-role connections + shared-server saturation on the console / ops
# Postgres, read load on the selfcare replica and Nexus, box CPU / memory / disk, Fixed ingest freshness.
# Mail policy (26 Sep 2026): a change of the picture mails at once; a persisting CRIT is re-notified after HC_CRIT_THROTTLE_MIN (30),
# then the wait doubles up to HC_CRIT_MAX_MIN (360); WARN after HC_WARN_THROTTLE_MIN (120) doubling up to HC_WARN_MAX_MIN (720);
# OK once as the recovery notice. A % probe keeps its level until it is HC_HYST_PCT (2) points below the threshold it crossed
# (no WARN/CRIT flapping at 95-97 %). Memory = MemTotal - MemAvailable from /proc/meminfo; when it is not OK the mail names the
# largest processes (ps, read-only).
